# .zshrc.local — hotdog (desktop)
# Sourced at the end of zsh/.zshrc.

# Deliberately does NOT define the PRIME helpers from zsh-xps/.zshrc.local.
# ~/.local/bin/gpu-off exists here (the bin package is shared), but the
# RTX 4070 Ti is the only GPU driving the display — unbinding it blanks the
# screen. Keeping the wrappers off this machine removes the foot-gun.
